IMPORTANT: Redesign/fix the app around the REAL core purpose of this product.

This is NOT a full trading/broker app.

The app's ONLY main purpose is:

**Search an Indian stock → Open stock → BUY/SELL → Risk Management → Calculate Stop Loss & Target → Confirm → Place the broker order with SL/TP.**

The user may connect a broker such as Dhan. The user's broker remains the source for actual account/trading execution. Our app is the **risk-management and order-entry layer**, not a replacement for the broker app.

